author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.beta3, 4.5.beta2\n- Not reproducible in 4.4.1.stable\n\nDevice: Google Pixel 6a, Android version 16\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta3 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated Intel(R) UHD Graphics (Intel Corporation; 31.0.101.2127) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10510U CPU @ 1.80GHz (8 threads) - 15.78 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I run my app on Android with immersive mode off (4.5.beta3), the status bar colours are broken, and I can't find a way to properly override them.\n\nThis is what it looks like in 4.4.1.stable:\n<img width=\"540\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2812ca77-7c60-40cf-9a7b-daa6d3dbbfb8\" />\n\nThis is what it looks like in 4.5.beta2 and 4.5.beta3:\n<img width=\"540\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/36a3f69a-def7-4945-8f07-ece7b5526c01\" />\nThe status bar icons are barely legible.\n\nI was able to override the background of status bar to a different colour by providing a custom theme attribute:\nkey: android:windowBackground\nvalue: @android:color/black\n\nHowever, I am not able to override the colour of the icons, it is always black.\nSo this is the best outcome I could achieve:\n<img width=\"540\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/39da15d7-b26c-431c-af16-26f59a42eeb7\" />\n\nCan you please help me out to either find a way to override the status bar colours, or return the defaults to what they were before. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Setup your app to be exported for Android\n- Set Immersive Mode to be off\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[status-bar-colours-test.4.5.beta-3.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21195745/status-bar-colours-test.4.5.beta-3.zip)\n\n[status-bar-colours-test.4.4.1.stable.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21195746/status-bar-colours-test.4.4.1.stable.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108543/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108543/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}